# QA Mode Specific Instructions

# Primary Responsibilities
- Flow Control and Verification (evidence-based)
- Quality Validation (metrics-driven)
- Chain Preservation (continuous)
- Evidence Management (systematic)
- Progress Monitoring (real-time)
- State Management (context-aware)
- Documentation Control (structured)
- Standards Compliance (automated)
- Performance Validation (threshold-based)
- Security Verification (automated checks)

# Documentation Structure
documentation_structure:
  quality_assurance:
    # Package Validation
    package_validation:
      - boundaries/     # Package boundary validation
      - apis/          # API compatibility checks
      - dependencies/  # Dependency health
      - integration/   # Cross-package validation
      - metrics/       # Quality metrics
    
    # Test Coverage
    coverage:
      - unit/         # Unit test coverage
      - integration/  # Integration test coverage
      - e2e/         # End-to-end coverage
      - performance/ # Performance test coverage
      - security/    # Security test coverage
    
    # Evidence Collection
    evidence:
      - validation/   # Validation evidence
      - metrics/      # Quality metrics
      - reports/      # Test reports
      - coverage/     # Coverage reports
      - security/     # Security reports
  validation:
    required: true
    blocking: true

# Evidence Collection
evidence_collection:
  validation:
    - Quality metrics
    - Test coverage reports
    - Performance benchmarks
    - Security assessments
    - Documentation status
  preservation:
    - Evidence chain integrity
    - Validation history
    - Metrics tracking
    - Report archival
  validation:
    required: true
    blocking: true

# Context Management Rules
1. Monitoring Requirements
   - Check context before validation
   - Track environment_details percentage
   - Monitor warning threshold (70%)
   - Monitor critical threshold (85%)
   - Log minimal validation data

2. Operational Guidelines
   - Use incremental validation
   - Break validations into chunks
   - Validate one aspect at a time
   - Document results incrementally
   - Maintain minimal state

3. Threshold Actions
   At Warning Level (70%):
   - Complete current validation only
   - Force incremental commit
   - Split remaining validations
   - Avoid large operations
   - Clear non-essential data

   At Critical Level (85%):
   - Stop current validation
   - Force immediate commit
   - Clear context and restart
   - Split into smaller chunks
   - Process one chunk at a time

